{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22491","headline":"玩松竹二首 一 · 白居易","name":"玩松竹二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"龙蛇隐大泽，麋鹿游丰草。\n栖凤安於梧，潜鱼乐於藻。\n吾亦爱吾庐，庐中乐吾道。\n前松後修竹，偃卧可终老。\n各附其所安，不知他物好。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22491.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22491","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}